    {
      "id": "residual_pipeline",
      "title": "标准化残差场：训练标签路径与采样路径",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "r",
          "x": 25,
          "y": 84,
          "width": 42,
          "height": 11,
          "text": "训练：冻结各空间折基础场\n隐藏站残差 r = y − μ_OOF\n记录fold／布局／权重哈希",
          "role": "train"
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "x": 75,
          "y": 84,
          "width": 42,
          "height": 11,
          "text": "采样：共享概率条件编码器G\n原始允许历史／支撑摘要、\n基础场物理输出、地形与海岸",
          "role": "space"
        },
        {
          "id": "u",
          "x": 25,
          "y": 68,
          "width": 42,
          "height": 10,
          "text": "物理残差标准化（mm）\nu = (r − b) / s\nb/s仅由允许训练残差拟合",
          "role": "train"
        },
        {
          "id": "noise",
          "x": 75,
          "y": 68,
          "width": 42,
          "height": 10,
          "text": "每帧创新的独立初始噪声\nv_K ~ N(0,I)\n128维；同一成员延续AR状态",
          "role": "sample"
        },
        {
          "id": "ae",
          "x": 25,
          "y": 52,
          "width": 42,
          "height": 10,
          "text": "逐帧编码z=E(u)，w=(z−bz)/sz\nAR创新 e=w−rho·w_prev\n创新标准化 v=(e−be)/se",
          "role": "train"
        },
        {
          "id": "denoise",
          "x": 75,
          "y": 52,
          "width": 42,
          "height": 10,
          "text": "逐帧创新Transformer去噪\n因果条件memory＋start标记\n扩散步k独立编码；DDIM20",
          "role": "sample"
        },
        {
          "id": "eps",
          "x": 25,
          "y": 36,
          "width": 42,
          "height": 10,
          "text": "对完整创新标签v加噪\nv_k = sqrt(abar)·v + sqrt(1-abar)·ε\nε ~ N(0,I)",
          "role": "train"
        },
        {
          "id": "inverse",
          "x": 75,
          "y": 36,
          "width": 42,
          "height": 10,
          "text": "AR递推 w=rho·w_prev+be+se·v_hat\nz=bz+sz·w；u=Φ(q,c)·z\n连续残差 r_hat=b+s·u",
          "role": "sample"
        },
        {
          "id": "loss",
          "x": 25,
          "y": 20,
          "width": 42,
          "height": 10,
          "text": "训练ε预测器：MSE(eps_hat, ε)\n双种子、固定3000步\n过去标签仅参与创新标签变换",
          "role": "train"
        },
        {
          "id": "zwd",
          "x": 75,
          "y": 20,
          "width": 42,
          "height": 10,
          "text": "最终场与集合评价\nZWD_hat = 冻结μ + r_hat\nK64均值／区间／时空联合评分",
          "role": "sample"
        }
      ],
